{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_7a0f8de7aa9c6f961325e310fd5977e2052c9b5363c3f4adf1b99d56aee2510f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A model selector lets users switch between Claude models (Opus 4.5, Sonnet 4.5, Haiku 4.5), including a /model slash command and default model in settings."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7a8b51e8999587c202c2231420971e5f1099d98e098a4265986fbfe2bc871502"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: the README welcomes contributions via pull requests, and the changelog records CI verification-matrix and caching build practices."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8bef16158fa27fe6fae1d8d332697dd2e19f549bbae0db3e5ba43f768f42733c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The architecture appears to use RSocket over WebSocket for streaming chat and plain HTTP for non-streaming IDE actions, per the changelog's RSocket migration notes and AGENTS.md protocol descriptions."},{"claim_ids":["clm_953af7d2190798029e07225a1c336389a9d8b953449a8688d3941f6f09fcc24e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The plugin supports MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers to extend Claude's capabilities, with status monitoring, reconnect, and enable/disable controls."},{"claim_ids":["clm_bb863e917286dc6399fdc3a820cac94f124ba96595c1466a9f31aaca752b1154"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"File write operations go through a secure authorization dialog, and the plugin added a dynamic MCP tool allowlist for flexible tool permissions."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f2ef34ecd3c61427733d85f237a0a463a44bc88a3a4d19f5b65614dcf557b2ae"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Sessions support reconnection: the plugin resumes a session using a stored conversation ID and auto-reconnects when the frontend becomes visible again."}],"claim_ids":["clm_7a0f8de7aa9c6f961325e310fd5977e2052c9b5363c3f4adf1b99d56aee2510f","clm_7a8b51e8999587c202c2231420971e5f1099d98e098a4265986fbfe2bc871502","clm_8bef16158fa27fe6fae1d8d332697dd2e19f549bbae0db3e5ba43f768f42733c","clm_953af7d2190798029e07225a1c3363